# Normalise line endings.
#
# Windows checkouts use CRLF locally, but everything committed to the repo
# is stored with LF. Without this, a Windows machine commits CRLF, then the
# Linux CI runner and the Vercel build see files that differ from what you
# see locally -- which produces "changed the whole file" diffs and, in the
# worst case, shell scripts that won't run. Set it once, forget it forever.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never touch these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.gz binary
*.zip binary
